  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: "<size=18>-A multiplier of Total Bet is awarded as Bonus Pay.\n-3 or more
      Scatters from the leftmost reel triggers Free   \n   Games with options.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '<size=18>- Wild substitutes for all symbols.

      - Wild appears on reels 2, 3, 4 and 5 only.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24></style>5  <style=coinColor>20</style>

      </style>4  <style=coinColor>5</style>

      </style>3  <style=coinColor>2</style></size></b>'
  - key: 
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=34>EXPANDING REEL FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<size=19>- Individual reel or reels may expand by up to 2 row during Free
      Games.

      - Maximum potential reel expansion is 5 x 5.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=34>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: "<size=19>-  3 or more Scatters from the leftmost reel triggers Free Games.\n-
      \ Upon Free Games, user chooses among 5 different options. \n-  The chosen 1x3
      symbol will appear instead of the regular 1x1 symbol. \n-  1x3 symbols are equivalent
      to three 1x1 symbols of the same animal. \n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>243 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 75</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.

      - Jackpots are available for qualifying bets only.'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: 4 Gods
  - key: SYMBOL_NAME_PAYTABLE_0
    value: <style=title><size=34>WILD</size></style>
  - key: SYMBOL_NAME_PAYTABLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=34>SCATTER</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: <size=19>12 Free Games         10 Free Games         8 Free Games         6
      Free Games         4 Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: '<style=title><size=34>Insert Symbols Feature

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=20>-  During Free Games, any covered areas of the chosen 1x3 symbols
      will be made visible by \n    extending the reels.\n-  Any symbols that were
      existing above them in the reel set will also be pushed up.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_3
    value: <size=88>>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=19>\n-  The Gamble Feature is triggered when Total win is at least
      10x Total Bet.\n-  When triggered, user may take win or gamble. \n-  User may
      gamble consecutively up to 5 times. \n-  If user loses, all its winnings will
      be lost.\n-  There is no gamble feature during Free Games. It may only be triggered
      once Free Games end.\n\n\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: '<style=title><size=34>Gamble Feature

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_2
    value: '<size=26>Win up to 1000x initial win or 120 Free Games!



'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: "<size=19>-  When triggered, user may choose from several gamble options
      that show different \n    wins and win probabilities.\n-  Win probabilities
      differ based on the win amount and type.\n-  User wins if the arrow stops in
      the win area and loses if it stops in the red. \n-  When gambling with winnings
      from Free Games won through the gamble feature,\n    only coin prizes will be
      available for gamble.\n\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: '<style=title><size=34>GOD OF WEALTH JACKPOT


      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6
    value: "<size=19>-  Wild symbols appearing during either Base or Free Games may
      randomly trigger the God of Wealth \n    Jackpot.\n-  Pick among 12 Jackpot
      coins until 3 of the same Jackpots are selected.\n-  Mini, Minor, Mega, or Grand
      Jackpot may be awarded.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12_FREE_COUNT
    value: '<size=24><b>5 <style=coinColor>20</style></b>

      <b>4 <style=coinColor>5</style></b>

      <b>3 <style=coinColor>2</style></size></b>'
